{"title": "Sizzling Cataclysm", "pageid": 8057, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Sizzling_Cataclysm", "categories": ["Spells that last until long rest", "Spells", "Level 4 Spells", "Evocation spells", "Actions", "Unique Spells"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Protection_from_Energy_Acid.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Protection_from_Energy_Acid.webp/300px-Protection_from_Energy_Acid.webp, /w/images/5/55/Protection_from_Energy_Acid.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Protection_from_Energy_Acid.webp/300px-Protection_from_Energy_Acid.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/55/Protection_from_Energy_Acid.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Sizzling Cataclysm </b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 4 evocation spell</a>. It is a variant of <a href=\"/wiki/Kereska%27s_Favour\" title=\"Kereska's Favour\">Kereska's Favour</a> that allows its caster to imbue themselves with the power of acid and unlock resistances and spells associated with it. It is granted by <a href=\"/wiki/Markoheshkir\" title=\"Markoheshkir\">Markoheshkir</a>.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Embrace Kereska's acid to gain <a href=\"/wiki/Resistance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resistance\">resistance</a> to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-acid\">Acid</span></a> damage. Your acid spells deal additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-acid\">Acid</span></a> damage equal to your <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency_bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Proficiency bonus\">proficiency bonus</a>. \n</p><p>When you deal spell damage, possibly inflict 3<sup class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\"><i>[<a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#Notes\">See Notes</a>]</i></sup> turns of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Noxious_Fumes_(Condition)\" title=\"Noxious Fumes (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Noxious Fumes\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2a/Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Noxious_Fumes_(Condition)\" title=\"Noxious Fumes (Condition)\">Noxious Fumes</a> upon the target. While attuned to Kereska's acid you can cast <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow\" title=\"Melf's Acid Arrow\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp/25px-Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/67/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp/38px-Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/67/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp/50px-Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Melf's Acid Arrow\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp/25px-Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/67/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow\" title=\"Melf's Acid Arrow\">Melf's Acid Arrow</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hunger_of_Hadar\" title=\"Hunger of Hadar\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/44/Hunger_of_Hadar_Icon.webp/25px-Hunger_of_Hadar_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/44/Hunger_of_Hadar_Icon.webp/38px-Hunger_of_Hadar_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/44/Hunger_of_Hadar_Icon.webp/50px-Hunger_of_Hadar_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hunger of Hadar\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/44/Hunger_of_Hadar_Icon.webp/25px-Hunger_of_Hadar_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/44/Hunger_of_Hadar_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hunger_of_Hadar\" title=\"Hunger of Hadar\">Hunger of Hadar</a> once each per <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">short rest</a>.\n</p>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow\" title=\"Melf's Acid Arrow\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp/40px-Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/67/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp/60px-Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/67/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp/80px-Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Melf's Acid Arrow\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp/40px-Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/67/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow\" title=\"Melf's Acid Arrow\">Melf's Acid Arrow</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Cast as a level 5 spell (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hunger_of_Hadar\" title=\"Hunger of Hadar\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/44/Hunger_of_Hadar_Icon.webp/40px-Hunger_of_Hadar_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/44/Hunger_of_Hadar_Icon.webp/60px-Hunger_of_Hadar_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/44/Hunger_of_Hadar_Icon.webp/80px-Hunger_of_Hadar_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hunger of Hadar\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/44/Hunger_of_Hadar_Icon.webp/40px-Hunger_of_Hadar_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/44/Hunger_of_Hadar_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hunger_of_Hadar\" title=\"Hunger of Hadar\">Hunger of Hadar</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Cast as a level 5 spell (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: Self\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: Self</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a></dd></dl>\n<p>Can cast <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow\" title=\"Melf's Acid Arrow\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp/25px-Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/67/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp/38px-Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/67/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp/50px-Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Melf's Acid Arrow\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp/25px-Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/67/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow\" title=\"Melf's Acid Arrow\">Melf's Acid Arrow</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hunger_of_Hadar\" title=\"Hunger of Hadar\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/44/Hunger_of_Hadar_Icon.webp/25px-Hunger_of_Hadar_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/44/Hunger_of_Hadar_Icon.webp/38px-Hunger_of_Hadar_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/44/Hunger_of_Hadar_Icon.webp/50px-Hunger_of_Hadar_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hunger of Hadar\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/44/Hunger_of_Hadar_Icon.webp/25px-Hunger_of_Hadar_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/44/Hunger_of_Hadar_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hunger_of_Hadar\" title=\"Hunger of Hadar\">Hunger of Hadar</a> once each per <a href=\"/wiki/Short_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short Rest\">Short Rest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<p>Casting this spell at a higher level grants no additional benefit. </p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_MAG_TheChromatic_AcidAttunement</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_MAG_TheChromatic_AcidAttunement\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_MAG_TheChromatic_AcidAttunement\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/HasSomaticComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasSomaticComponent (spell flag)\">HasSomaticComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasVerbalComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsSpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsSpell (spell flag)\">IsSpell</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span id=\"Condition:_Adrip_with_Kereska.27s_Acid\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Adrip_with_Kereska's_Acid\"> Condition: Adrip with Kereska's Acid </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Adrip_with_Kereska%27s_Acid_(Condition)\" title=\"Adrip with Kereska's Acid (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Adrip with Kereska's Acid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/57/Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Adrip_with_Kereska%27s_Acid_(Condition)\" title=\"Adrip with Kereska's Acid (Condition)\">Adrip with Kereska's Acid</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Until <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity has <a href=\"/wiki/Resistance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resistance\">resistance</a> to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-acid\">Acid</span></a> damage.</li>\n<li>Its acid spells deal additional damage equal to its <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency_bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Proficiency bonus\">proficiency bonus</a>.</li>\n<li>When it deals spell damage, it possibly inflict 3 turns of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Noxious_Fumes_(Condition)\" title=\"Noxious Fumes (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Noxious Fumes\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2a/Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Noxious_Fumes_(Condition)\" title=\"Noxious Fumes (Condition)\">Noxious Fumes</a> upon the target.</li>\n<li>While attuned to Kereska's acid it can cast <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow\" title=\"Melf's Acid Arrow\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp/25px-Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/67/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp/38px-Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/67/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp/50px-Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Melf's Acid Arrow\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp/25px-Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/67/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow\" title=\"Melf's Acid Arrow\">Melf's Acid Arrow</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hunger_of_Hadar\" title=\"Hunger of Hadar\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/44/Hunger_of_Hadar_Icon.webp/25px-Hunger_of_Hadar_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/44/Hunger_of_Hadar_Icon.webp/38px-Hunger_of_Hadar_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/44/Hunger_of_Hadar_Icon.webp/50px-Hunger_of_Hadar_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hunger of Hadar\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/44/Hunger_of_Hadar_Icon.webp/25px-Hunger_of_Hadar_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/44/Hunger_of_Hadar_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hunger_of_Hadar\" title=\"Hunger of Hadar\">Hunger of Hadar</a> at 5th level once per short rest.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by items:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Markoheshkir\" title=\"Markoheshkir\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Markoheshkir_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Markoheshkir_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1c/Markoheshkir_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Markoheshkir_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1c/Markoheshkir_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Markoheshkir_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Markoheshkir_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Markoheshkir_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1c/Markoheshkir_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Markoheshkir\" title=\"Markoheshkir\">Markoheshkir</a></span> </li>\n</ul>\n<p>This spell is a variation of:<br>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Kereska%27s_Favour\" title=\"Kereska's Favour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/15/Protection_from_Energy_Icon.webp/40px-Protection_from_Energy_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/15/Protection_from_Energy_Icon.webp/60px-Protection_from_Energy_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/15/Protection_from_Energy_Icon.webp/80px-Protection_from_Energy_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Kereska's Favour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/15/Protection_from_Energy_Icon.webp/40px-Protection_from_Energy_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/15/Protection_from_Energy_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Kereska%27s_Favour\" title=\"Kereska's Favour\">Kereska's Favour</a></span>\n</p>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The in-game tooltip for this spell says its effect inflicts Noxious Fumes for 1 turn, but it actually inflicts it for 3 turns. It also requires a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;13 Dexterity Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dice_rolls#Save_DCs\" title=\"Dice rolls\">DC</a>&nbsp;13 <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a> to apply the condition.</li>\n<li>Possibly applying Noxious Fumes can only occur once per attack. A spell hitting multiple targets will still only make a single saving throw for one of the targets to apply the condition.</li>\n<li>This is the only variant of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Kereska%27s_Favour\" title=\"Kereska's Favour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/15/Protection_from_Energy_Icon.webp/25px-Protection_from_Energy_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/15/Protection_from_Energy_Icon.webp/38px-Protection_from_Energy_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/15/Protection_from_Energy_Icon.webp/50px-Protection_from_Energy_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Kereska's Favour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/15/Protection_from_Energy_Icon.webp/25px-Protection_from_Energy_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/15/Protection_from_Energy_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Kereska%27s_Favour\" title=\"Kereska's Favour\">Kereska's Favour</a> that requires a saving throw to inflict its condition. The ice, thunder, and poison variants all apply their respective conditions without a saving throw.</li>\n<li>The version of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow\" title=\"Melf's Acid Arrow\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp/25px-Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/67/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp/38px-Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/67/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp/50px-Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Melf's Acid Arrow\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp/25px-Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/67/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow\" title=\"Melf's Acid Arrow\">Melf's Acid Arrow</a> granted by this spell matches the damage of a level 5 upcasted version (<span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-acid\">7d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-acid\">Acid</span></a> + <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-acid\">5d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-acid\">Acid</span></a> delayed), but it only counts as a level 2 spell.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715051701\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.134 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.140 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 6572/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 98127/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 46890/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.027/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1488429/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n111.16%  128.431     85 Template:Trim\n100.00%  115.533      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%  115.533      1 -total\n 27.41%   31.663     20 Template:Icon_text\n 19.62%   22.667     13 Template:Icon_link\n 16.34%   18.882      2 Template:Spell_action\n 11.51%   13.293      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n  9.52%   10.995      6 Template:SAI\n  8.41%    9.716     22 Template:Ifempty\n  8.02%    9.262     22 Template:Icon\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:8057-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715051701 and revision id 343541. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}